    "body": "Continue the existing native geometric source realizer with learned context frozen and Copy/Period/Stop readouts coadapting. Complete own-prefix replies improve4→18/20 with all four parent successes preserved and EOS20/20; final canonical decisions improve46→112/114 with no final parent regressions. The two remaining failures repeat Klotdradburg's Copy-order error at step4. This is exposed development on five numerical source/query groups, not general chat or unseen-source qualification.\n\nThe new standalone example mode reuses existing Rust prepared loss, AdamW, native export/reload and generation. Context parameters and gradients are excluded before clipping; exact context bits are checked every update and packed context/table hashes at checkpoints. Baseline packed payloads and generated replies reproduce the parent exactly. Optimizer moments start fresh because the original artifact did not save them. Checkpoints0/16/32/48/64 and all gains/regressions are retained.\n\nValidation: seven focused Rust tests and optimized build pass on owner-authorized CPU-only Runpod at54bf68c7; the64-update fit/evaluation completes in343.506s, maxchildRSS2,283,810,816B. Independent source/result review recomputes native masses, ties, CE, all570 canonical positions and complete generation. All122 returned files match the complete remote SHA256 inventory. Metal unavailable onLinux, not counted; Rust seals verified onpod, no independent local BLAKE3 rehash claim. Source unchanged at reviewed deliveryhead47e85593756689e803ec19f980bbe1d29e48bfa4; wording/format/diff checks pass.\n\nRetain final64 as an unadopted component candidate. Current-state/roadmap now choose fixed novel-source/order-transfer and paired source replacements against the parent before shared-session integration. That panel is NOT_RUN. Shared session code is untouched. Pod reservation released and ownedarea about5.84GiB; all results are local, cumulative cost recorded.\n\nThis PR includes and supersedes the unmerged direction-diagnostic PR #1665, preserving its source, report and evidence plus the executed continuation. Both are delivered to main through this protected PR; the original branch remains preserved.\n\nReferences #1552, #1512, #820.\n",
